00:12:19,020 --> 00:12:36,020
Kotori, Kotori, Kotori, Kotori!

281
00:12:36,020 --> 00:12:50,100
Whoa, what was that?

282
00:13:06,020 --> 00:13:17,820
It's... a girl.

283
00:13:17,820 --> 00:13:20,200
What's she doing?

284
00:13:20,200 --> 00:13:31,340
Not you, too.

285
00:13:36,020 --> 00:13:58,700
I see... so it's true.

286
00:13:58,700 --> 00:14:03,700
You came here to kill me.

287
00:14:03,700 --> 00:14:12,920
Do not try denying you are here to kill me.

288
00:14:12,920 --> 00:14:15,460
I must deal with you before the others arrive.

289
00:14:15,460 --> 00:14:16,460
Wait!

290
00:14:16,460 --> 00:14:17,460
Just wait, please!

291
00:14:17,460 --> 00:14:18,460
That's...

292
00:14:18,460 --> 00:14:19,460
That's not why I came here.

293
00:14:19,460 --> 00:14:20,460
What?

294
00:14:20,460 --> 00:14:21,460
I...

295
00:14:21,460 --> 00:14:22,460
I could never kill anybody.

296
00:14:22,460 --> 00:14:25,460
Is that what you're here for?

297
00:14:25,460 --> 00:14:42,680
Why do they not realize the futility of their attacks?

298
00:14:42,680 --> 00:14:51,900
This isn't just any girl.

299
00:14:51,900 --> 00:15:11,120
If she's that strong, why does she look so sad?

300
00:15:11,120 --> 00:15:23,340
heal my leg?

301
00:15:23,340 --> 00:15:26,340
Yeah!

302
00:15:26,340 --> 00:15:45,980
Tobechi? Is that you?

303
00:15:47,360 --> 00:15:49,400
Shida, it's you.

304
00:15:50,400 --> 00:15:52,200
Why are you wearing those clothes?

305
00:15:56,340 --> 00:16:02,380
No!

306
00:16:10,880 --> 00:16:12,480
No!

307
00:16:12,480 --> 00:16:35,000
Coordinates FJ1820. The target, Princess, has been lost.

308
00:16:35,220 --> 00:16:37,520
Area reaction waves below detection threshold.

309
00:16:37,700 --> 00:16:38,060
Hello?

310
00:16:38,060 --> 00:16:43,040
That is confirmed. Finally, we meet again.

311
00:16:43,980 --> 00:16:44,840
Who are you?

312
00:16:45,460 --> 00:17:00,260
I'm so glad that just we had. Just a little while longer. I won't ever let you go again. I won't ever be wrong again. Soon.

313
00:17:08,060 --> 00:17:10,820
Hmm. It appears you're awake now.

314
00:17:10,900 --> 00:17:12,980
Wait. I don't know you. Who are you?

315
00:17:13,300 --> 00:17:22,400
My name is Reina Murasame. Just call me Reina. I'm the head analyst here. There's no reason for you to freak out. First aid is hardly out of my league.

316
00:17:22,400 --> 00:17:31,260
That's supposed to be reassuring. So, here's a question. Where exactly am I?

317
00:17:31,380 --> 00:17:36,900
You're resting in Fraxinus' sickbay. You are unconscious, so it was decided this was the best course of action.

318
00:17:37,200 --> 00:17:43,080
Fraxinus' what now? Did I pass out? Oh, right. I ended up in the middle of that chick fight.

319
00:17:43,080 --> 00:17:51,060
Wait. Coterie. But my sister. I need to go find my sister. She's waiting for me in front of the diner. She could be...

320
00:17:51,060 --> 00:17:54,580
What you need is to calm down. Your sister is perfectly fine.

321
00:17:54,800 --> 00:17:55,940
What? She is?

322
00:17:56,600 --> 00:18:04,820
I'm assuming you want some sort of explanation now? Apologies, but that isn't really my forte. You should ask the vice commander for more details.

323
00:18:04,820 --> 00:18:08,240
I've brought him with me.

324
00:18:10,020 --> 00:18:19,260
Thank you for taking care of him. It's very nice to meet you. My name is Kyohei Kanazuki, and I am the vice commander. Welcome, Shido. We're glad you're here.

325
00:18:28,540 --> 00:18:28,860
Coterie?

326
00:18:28,860 --> 00:18:34,260
Glad you could make it, bro. Like the idiot said, welcome to Rattata-skirt.

327
00:18:37,260 --> 00:18:40,500
Penetration angle, check. Anus, set.

328
00:18:46,440 --> 00:18:48,320
Police. Connection.

329
00:18:52,320 --> 00:18:54,720
I got you. Good work.

330
00:18:55,080 --> 00:18:56,020
Captain Kasabe.

331
00:18:56,020 --> 00:19:01,160
You're working yourself too hard. Take it easy, okay?

332
00:19:01,740 --> 00:19:08,260
This thing is a monster called a spirit. It was lost not long ago. That means it disappeared. And this is what we call it...

333
00:19:08,260 --> 00:19:09,320
Wait, will you shut up for a second?

334
00:19:09,880 --> 00:19:16,720
Don't be rude. The commander's taking the time to explain everything to you personally. You should be on your knees bowing in gratitude.

335
00:19:17,260 --> 00:19:20,880
If you want, I certainly wouldn't mind letting you lick my boots while you're down there.

336
00:19:21,020 --> 00:19:22,200
What? Really? I can?

337
00:19:22,200 --> 00:19:25,860
Oh, yeah. Thank you for that, commander.

338
00:19:26,660 --> 00:19:29,040
And, uh, you are Coterie.

339
00:19:29,300 --> 00:19:32,860
Of course. Have you forgotten what my face looks like? Shido.

340
00:19:33,240 --> 00:19:34,020
No, bro.

341
00:19:34,220 --> 00:19:37,360
I knew your memory was bad, but not Alzheimer's bad.

342
00:19:38,020 --> 00:19:41,100
Well, I guess we'll have to admit you to a nursing home pretty soon.

343
00:19:41,500 --> 00:19:44,340
So, uh, what's going on? Where are we?

344
00:19:44,340 --> 00:19:51,040
Quit freaking. I'll explain the specifics to you later, but first, you need to remember the three things I'm about to say.

345
00:19:51,500 --> 00:19:59,660
One, that girl is a spirit. She doesn't belong in this world, and simply appearing on our planet causes everything around her to blow up whether she wants it to or not.

346
00:20:00,200 --> 00:20:01,580
Blow up? Why?

347
00:20:01,580 --> 00:20:10,060
You are so dumb. You know those things we call spatial quakes? Well, spirits just like that girl down there are the ones responsible for making them happen.

348
00:20:13,740 --> 00:20:16,000
How could one girl do all that?

349
00:20:17,460 --> 00:20:18,580
Ready for two?

350
00:20:18,580 --> 00:20:28,720
These are the Ground Force's anti-spirits team. When a spirit appears, the AST fly to their location and take care of it. Meaning they kill them.

351
00:20:29,260 --> 00:20:30,820
What? Kill them?

352
00:20:31,220 --> 00:20:34,180
It's true. You came here to kill me, didn't you?

353
00:20:35,320 --> 00:20:40,520
And now for three. There is another way to deal with these spirits without having to rely on the AST.

354
00:20:41,080 --> 00:20:44,040
This is the reason you're here and where your help will be most needed.

355
00:20:44,220 --> 00:20:45,420
