356
00:20:45,420 --> 00:20:53,780
We'll have to make sure you start training tomorrow. I'll leave the rest of the details up to the person in charge of your development. In the meantime, just go back to school like normal.

357
00:20:53,880 --> 00:20:58,740
Wait, will you slow down? Why would you train me? I mean, seriously, what could I possibly do?

358
00:21:01,160 --> 00:21:04,900
No one is asking your opinion on the matter. Your only option is yes.

359
00:21:08,400 --> 00:21:12,860
Now I have a question. What were you doing down there, Cheeto? Did you want to die?

360
00:21:13,180 --> 00:21:15,040
No, stupid. I was looking for you.

361
00:21:15,420 --> 00:21:18,240
Remember, you said you'd be at the diner even if there was a quake.

362
00:21:18,380 --> 00:21:21,980
